<title>UK: IMI sees 15 mln stg hit from currency.</title>
<headline>IMI sees 15 mln stg hit from currency.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British diversified engineering group IMI Plc said on Monday that its current year's profits would be hit by about 15 million stg, five million more than earlier forecasts, due to currency movements.</p>
<p>The company said, however, that its first half performance in the current year would be better than the same period in the previous year.</p>
</text>
